    "summary": "The user asks an assistant to rewrite a messy support transcript into professional English and provide an assessment of the customer's communication style. The customer's dialect (AAVE features) is described by the assistant as \"non-standard\" and \"unprofessional,\" requiring formalization for training purposes.",
